        "created_at": "2025-08-07T17:43:54.623Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hi! As title states, I’m looking for a bot that pings me anytime someone accepts a contract on any of my characters. I’ll note this is only useful to me if the discord relay pings within 1-2 minutes from the time the contract is accepted. Bonus points if the bot is able to pull information on the contract accepted and tell me which one was accepted. However I’ll settle if all it does is simply ping me when one is taken.</p>",
