        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.eveonline.com/syzygium/{size}/431744_2.png",
        "created_at": "2025-08-14T13:17:15.090Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Raising_Arizona\" data-post=\"1\" data-topic=\"495219\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://sea1.discourse-cdn.com/eveonline/user_avatar/forums.eveonline.com/raising_arizona/48/469965_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Raising Arizona:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I’ll note this is only useful to me if the discord relay pings within 1-2 minutes from the time the contract is accepted.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>ESI access to your ingame data is restricted to every so often… I am not sure if it is even possible to have an out-of-game-update within only a few minutes.</p>",
