        "created_at": "2025-08-14T13:44:54.135Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I checked ESI docs and it looks like contract data gets cached every 5 minutes, which I think would be what dictates how often op could have his contract data pull in (?)</p>\n<p>so yeah looks like a no on the 1-2 minutes bit, but 5ish would be doable</p>",
