      {
        "id": 2762735,
        "name": "Syzygium",
        "username": "Syzygium",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.eveonline.com/syzygium/{size}/431744_2.png",
        "created_at": "2025-08-14T13:55:21.186Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Well, you can try <img src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/twitter/slight_smile.png?v=14\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>“for science!” <img src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/twitter/stuck_out_tongue.png?v=14\" title=\":stuck_out_tongue:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":stuck_out_tongue:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>Those are the shortest query intervals selectable by EVEMon, no guarantee that this reflects the technical limitations, but since they have different values, I don’t see a reason why the EVEMon devs shouldn’t have used the minimum values available…</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://global.discourse-cdn.com/eveonline/original/4X/5/d/3/5d369939f5943de61a44ee6a1c7756aca2a422d2.png\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/diBnEOwS802z4GIBWoU9Zn2X92a.png?dl=1\" title=\"ESIquery01\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><img src=\"https://global.discourse-cdn.com/eveonline/original/4X/5/d/3/5d369939f5943de61a44ee6a1c7756aca2a422d2.png\" alt=\"ESIquery01\" data-base62-sha1=\"diBnEOwS802z4GIBWoU9Zn2X92a\" width=\"369\" height=\"337\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">ESIquery01</span><span class=\"informations\">369×337 6 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div><br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://global.discourse-cdn.com/eveonline/original/4X/2/a/d/2adbbaf5d6948183804494cb63c943b75f46a9ac.png\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/678P4CYHuCqGztt0IWLO8L0VI6M.png?dl=1\" title=\"ESIquery02\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><img src=\"https://global.discourse-cdn.com/eveonline/original/4X/2/a/d/2adbbaf5d6948183804494cb63c943b75f46a9ac.png\" alt=\"ESIquery02\" data-base62-sha1=\"678P4CYHuCqGztt0IWLO8L0VI6M\" width=\"366\" height=\"314\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">ESIquery02</span><span class=\"informations\">366×314 4.58 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>Maybe thats a start to work with.</p>",
